    "1. **Controlled Aesthetics**: Improved prompts produce consistent white backgrounds suitable for catalogs.\n",
    "2. **Detail Fidelity**: Material attributes (ceramic, mesh, cotton) are significantly more realistic.\n",
    "3. **Alignment**: The systematic template ensures the model doesn't drift from the input metadata."
   ]
